<h1>About</h1>

<p>
    This application demonstrates a Node.js and Express application
    organized using the Model-View-Controller architecture.
</p>

<h2>MVC Architecture</h2>

<p>
    Models manage application data, controllers manage application
    logic, and views are responsible for presenting information to
    the user.
</p>

<h2>Technologies</h2>

<ul>
    <li>Node.js</li>
    <li>Express</li>
    <li>EJS</li>
    <li>JavaScript</li>
</ul>

